    "approval_scope": "revision 2: adds two operations to function.cubic_graph - graph_cubic_functions (cubic drawing on one canvas, with optional a/p/h/k numbers and symmetry-centre parts) and cubic_option_graph (five option graphs for a given line) - for the seven Unit 10 rows that revision 1 deferred (12603-12607, 12613, 12626). Drawing parts are graded by the new shared cubic_graph drawing type (free_response_drawing_checker -> drawing_answer_analysis_service.evaluate_cubic_graph; curve shape, end behaviour, centre, turning points, zeros, hand-drawing tolerance). 12626 uses the existing coordinate_plane_multi_figure renderer, now accepting curves and a fixed range per panel (static/js/visual_spec.js). The existing 4 operations, their payloads and the 19 published Unit 10 components are unchanged in behaviour (the revision-2 package files only add code; 380 payloads of the 19 components were compared byte for byte)"
  },
